§ `Order 59 rule 12 -- attachment of debts`
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
#ASSERT `o 59 r 12(1) the order may be made` `o 59 r 12(1)(a) an order for the attachment of debts under Order 22` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `o 59 r 12(1) the order may be made` `o 59 r 12(1)(b) an order for the appointment of a receiver under Order 13, Rule 9` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
