-- (2): the last day for serving the summons is 4 December 2026 (made up).  Arguments: s 33(1) application; document; served on the Government; Court otherwise orders; served on the person; date of the later service; last day; affidavit.
#ASSERT `o 59 r 12(2) the period for serving the summons before the return day`'s `period length` EQUALS 4
#ASSERT `o 59 r 12(2) the application is made and served as the Rule requires` TRUE Summons TRUE FALSE TRUE (Date 4 12 2026) (Date 4 12 2026) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
